      "text": "AddSymptomScreen also reads AuthRepository (who signs the entry). A caregiver adds a symptom only if the patient allows it (canAdd, US-22);\nediting and deleting for the patient come with #341. The voice journal fills the same form, which the patient confirms before saving.",
